nvas7末典略曰彧為人偉美，canvas8–9，至canvas10傅子論禰衡完，止太祖問彧之前；不含欄外陳仁錫評語或日文訓點。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"1670刊古籍公共領域影像，歸屬大阪府立圖書館；本包不發布圖像，僅轉錄及來源連結。","license_url":"https://da.library.pref.osaka.jp/","edition":"寛文10年（1670）京都秋田屋山本平左衛門・村上勘兵衛；陳仁錫評閲，田犀一角訓點；石崎334/2/#，B12044772","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"transcription_policy":"AI逐字核讀指定影像接口；去日文訓點、圈點、版式，保留原字，疑讀另列。未借別本補字。","image_scope_verified_by_ai_only":true,"image_metadata":{"catalog_url":"https://da.library.pref.osaka.jp/content/detail/01-0015983","manifest_url":"https://da.library.pref.osaka.jp/api/items/01-0015983/manifest.json","manifest_sha256":"ee8dfb198352b488fd7f3bf22c93b0cd7859dc0eba0623bbb9d1775a4b7e3f08","holding_institution":"大阪府立圖書館，石崎文庫","catalog_id":"01-0015983","bibliographic_id":"B12044772","edition":"寛文10年（1670），[京都]秋田屋山本平左衛門・村上勘兵衛刊；陳仁錫評閲、田犀一角訓點","is_same_edition_as_kanripo":false,"image_check_scope_only":true,"pages_read":[6,7,8,9,10],"observations":[{"canvas":6,"observation":"徐州議論接軍熟慮之；未見後一遍重複。"},{"canvas":7,"observation":"建安元年迎獻帝、典略折節下士、太祖雖征伐在外，至又平原禰衡傳曰衡字正平，連續。"},{"canvas":8,"observation":"衡字正平後接建安初自荊州北游許都及孔融薦衡、許中問答、黃祖與衡故事；Kanripo缺此。"},{"canvas":9,"observation":"續臣松之案、張衡文士傳，鼓吏、裸身擊鼓、孔融促見等，左頁接坐太祖營門外以杖捶地數罵太祖；與Kanripo122行接口對應。"},{"canvas":10,"observation":"傅子論禰衡、太祖問彧誰能代卿，與Kanripo後續相接。"}],"image_files":[{"canvas":5,"canvas_url":"https://da.library.pref.osaka.jp/api/items/01-0015983/canvas/5","image_url":"https://da.library.pref.osaka.jp/api/contents/ee3b0a24e36e40d2adfe6ed6d0ea5b3d.jp2/full/2000,/0/default.jpg","sha256":"52b780e4af3711dcb21dfdd758d5d44bcce95bbfa80e0a3c6eadb0ffa9b2fc2e","read":false},{"canvas":6,"canvas_url":"https://da.library.pref.osaka.jp/api/items/01-0015983/canvas/6","image_url":"https://da.library.pref.osaka.jp/api/contents/73ef8d9def81480cb38a776419aa2c7c.jp2/full/2000,/0/default.jpg","sha256":"51bfcf44fd9b41ea27280748c05be8c452f85f8e2d704b8f446800b697f91aea","read":true},{"canvas":7,"canvas_url":"https://da.lib